<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns starts AVX with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns starts AVX with buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Cos Inc analyst Tom Hopkins started coverage of electronics component maker AVX Corp on Tuesday with a buy rating, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at $27 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- The Myrtle Beach, S.C., company makes semiconductor capacitors.</p>
</text>
